{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18843","headline":"更衣曲 · 刘禹锡","name":"更衣曲","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"博山炯炯吐香雾，红烛引至更衣处。\n夜如何其夜漫漫，邻鸡未鸣寒雁度。\n庭前雪压松桂丛，廊下点点悬纱笼。\n满堂醉客争笑语，嘈囋琵琶青幕中。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘禹锡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_18843.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_18843","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"乐府","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}